<h1 class="title">About BioTracker</h1>
<div class="content">
  <p>BioTracker aggregates data regarding global animal species, taxonomy categories, habitats, and wild observation events.</p>
  <h3>Data Sources</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Faker Gem:</strong> Provides randomized species names, scientific classifications, diets, and conservation statuses.</li>
    <li><strong>Leaflet & OpenStreetMap:</strong> Renders geographical observation coordinate maps.</li>
  </ul>
</div>